\[
N_i=\{j\in V_n:G(j,i)\}.
\]
Suppose:
\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{(Bounded degree.)} The graph \(G\) satisfies the bounded-degree condition with bound \(d\) in \(\cref{obj:ass:bounded-degree}\).
\item \textbf{(Order.)} The integer \(r\) satisfies \(r\ge 1\).
